      "rotation": "Wraith comps are generally auto-friendly that can have optimizations to squeeze more damage.General Rotation1.  Use both Support Skills2.  Use Wraith skills while weaving a few auto attacks between each skill activation to proc her tornadoesWhen to use Ultimate?• Wraith: Whenever there's a need to dodge big attacks from enemies (preferably also while waiting for her supports' skills cooldown to come back up).• Nazuka: Preferably when there's a break window and also when her Support Skill CD is around 7s+ to not delay its cast.• Ann: To block target attacks or disrupt disruptable enemies.Tips• Wraith: Use her Main Skill sparingly (keeping it at 2 stacks always) while waiting for Ann's Support Skill to snapshot her tornadoes with all of Ann's buffs.",
      "guide_ref": null
